==Battleground==
*5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*1 [[Large White Ball]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Red Ball]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Iron Ball]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Aku Cyclone]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Large Iron Ball]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
**4 [[Large Red Ball]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 1.33~2.67 seconds<sup>40f~80f</sup>.
**4 [[Large White Ball]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 2.67~5.33 seconds<sup>80f~160f</sup>.
**4 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 15~20 seconds<sup>450f~600f</sup>.
**8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~15 seconds<sup>300f~450f</sup>.
**16 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Because of the Aku Cyclone, this stage will be much harder without [[Shield Piercing]] and [[Anti-Aku Cats]], but luckily all of the enemies here are melee, so almost all options will work. [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Aku Researcher]] is useful due to being able to rush in with their speed to hit the exposed cyclone and deal [[Critical Hit|Critical Hits]] to the Large Iron Balls, as well as [[Talents|Talented]] [[Li'l Gross Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Gross Cat]] or [[Pied Piper Cat (Rare Cat)|Pied Piper Cat]] as needed.

Any general attackers with more than 200 range will be safe from every enemy if they do not push excessively, and [[Cyberpunk Cat]] and [[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Recruit]] are good options for controlling the Aku enemies if Cats specifically targeting them are not unlocked before this stage.

